        [49187] = "learn more",
        [49188] = "WHAT'S A CHANNEL?",
        [49189] = "Channels are themed, automatically refreshing song lists for use with Zune Music Pass. When you subscribe to a channel, you can listen to it, sync it with your device—even save it as a playlist in your collection. And whenever a channel is refreshed with new songs, you'll get the updates automatically.\n\nChannels are free to Zune Music Pass subscribers. Channels have their own area in your media collection where you can listen to them straight through, shuffle them, and play them repeatedly.\n\nTo preserve songs in your collection even after a channel is automatically updated, you can save a complete set of songs as a permanent playlist or add songs from your channels to your collection at any time.",
