        [52092] = "Your phone needs an update. To continue, make sure you're connected to the Internet. If you're connected and the phone doesn't update, please try again later.",
        [52093] = "Do you want to link this phone to a Zune Tag? Your Zune Tag is a unique name that represents you in the Zune online community. Use it to access your inbox in the Zune software, send songs and other items to friends, and view your online profile at Zune.net.",
